The JPEGs in testdata/benchmark/ are crops and resizes supplied by PlaceKitten.
The licenses below apply to those JPEGs and to their embedded copies in
testdata/assets/bindata.go. The numbers in the first column are JPEG filenames
without the .jpg extension. The PlaceKitten image numbers identify the previews
on the archived attribution page.

